    "text": "## Scope\n\nThe archive purge job removes expired ledger exports. It never affects active ledger snapshots.\n\n## Preconditions\n\nBefore deleting the bucket, verify both conditions:\n\n1. Export `export-2027-02-18` is confirmed complete.\n2. Change ticket `OPS-6634` carries approval.\n\nWARNING: The following deletion command permanently destroys bucket `ledger-archive-legacy`. Recovery afterward requires restoring from cold storage.\n\nOnly after both preconditions are satisfied, run:\n\n```bash\nvaultctl delete bucket ledger-archive-legacy --confirm\n```\n\n## Verification\n\nConfirm the outcome by running `vaultctl describe bucket ledger-archive-legacy`.",
